* eeg_afe: chopper-stabilised capacitively coupled instrumentation amplifier (GF180, this rev)
* Written by gf180/tapeout/afe/make_afe_netlist.py from gf180/tapeout/sim/afe/afe_noise.py
* (core 1, tg 256, ln 1.5, lp 0.28, mp 1, itail 3, scasc 1, tgo 8, boosters N [20.0, 4.0, 16, 0.001], P [20.0, 2.0, 64, 0.0006],
* booster load L 8 um). Do not edit by hand; change the generator and rerun.
* CCIA diagnostic: original MOS dimensions, physical input/output TG.
* Input TG precede Cin; fixed internal Cf/reset/CMFB/compensation.
* 18 core/CMFB MOS + 16 switch MOS; no periodic-noise claim.
.subckt eeg_afe_output_tg A B G GN VDD VSS
XN A G B VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=.28u nf=1 m=8 ad=10p as=10p pd=41u ps=41u nrd=.025 nrs=.025
XP A GN B VDD pfet_03v3 W=40u L=.28u nf=1 m=8 ad=20p as=20p pd=81u ps=81u nrd=.0125 nrs=.0125
.ends eeg_afe_output_tg

.subckt eeg_afe_input_tg A B G GN VDD VSS
XN A G B VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=.28u nf=1 m=256 ad=10p as=10p pd=41u ps=41u nrd=.025 nrs=.025
XP A GN B VDD pfet_03v3 W=40u L=.28u nf=1 m=256 ad=20p as=20p pd=81u ps=81u nrd=.0125 nrs=.0125
.ends eeg_afe_input_tg
* Newcascoded current-reuse candidate cas_L1; inputW/L unchanged, area reduced.
* Complementary current-reuse differential input stage. No ideal gm source.
* N/P input transconductances add; source tails share the branch current.
* Real8MOS gate-only CMFB controls the PMOS upper tail.
.subckt eeg_afe_core INP INN OUTP OUTN VBN VBP BLP BLN VDD VSS
XN_P DNP INP SN VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=1.5u nf=1 m=2048 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=0.05 nrs=0.05
XN_N DNN INN SN VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=1.5u nf=1 m=2048 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=0.05 nrs=0.05
XP_P DPP INP SP VDD pfet_03v3 W=10u L=0.28u nf=1 m=4096 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=0.05 nrs=0.05
XP_N DPN INN SP VDD pfet_03v3 W=10u L=0.28u nf=1 m=4096 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=0.05 nrs=0.05
XNT SN VBN VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=1u nf=1 m=768 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
XPT SP VBP VDD VDD pfet_03v3 W=10u L=2u nf=1 m=2048 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
XNC_P OUTN GNCP DNP VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=1u nf=1 m=512 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
XNC_N OUTP GNCN DNN VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=1u nf=1 m=512 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
XPC_P OUTN GPCP DPP VDD pfet_03v3 W=10u L=1u nf=1 m=1024 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
XPC_N OUTP GPCN DPN VDD pfet_03v3 W=10u L=1u nf=1 m=1024 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
XGNCPB GNCP DNP VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=4u nf=1 m=16
XGNCPL GNCP BLP VDD VDD pfet_03v3 W=20u L=8u nf=1 m=32
XGNCNB GNCN DNN VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=4u nf=1 m=16
XGNCNL GNCN BLP VDD VDD pfet_03v3 W=20u L=8u nf=1 m=32
XGPCPB GPCP DPP VDD VDD pfet_03v3 W=20u L=2u nf=1 m=64
XGPCPL GPCP BLN VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=8u nf=1 m=20
XGPCNB GPCN DPN VDD VDD pfet_03v3 W=20u L=2u nf=1 m=64
XGPCNL GPCN BLN VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=8u nf=1 m=20
XBLPD BLP BLP VDD VDD pfet_03v3 W=20u L=8u nf=1 m=4
XBLND BLN BLN VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=20u L=8u nf=1 m=4
.ends eeg_afe_core
.subckt eeg_afe_cmfb OUTP OUTN VCMREF VBCM VBP VDD VSS
XCM1 ND OUTP NTA VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=2u nf=1 m=4 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
