XCMT2 NTB VBCM VSS VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=2u nf=1 m=2 ad=5p as=5p pd=21u ps=21u nrd=.05 nrs=.05
.ends eeg_afe_cmfb


* CCIA: explicit electrodes, switched capacitor plates, fixed core input/output ports.
.subckt eeg_afe_amp EP EN WP WN INP INN OPI ONI OUTP OUTN VCM VBN VBCM BLP BLN VBP CIA NCIA CIB NCIB CDA NCDA CDB NCDB VDD VSS
XIP_A EP WP CIA NCIA VDD VSS eeg_afe_input_tg
XIN_A EN WN CIA NCIA VDD VSS eeg_afe_input_tg
XIP_B EP WN CIB NCIB VDD VSS eeg_afe_input_tg
XIN_B EN WP CIB NCIB VDD VSS eeg_afe_input_tg
XCORE INP INN OPI ONI VBN VBP BLP BLN VDD VSS eeg_afe_core
XOP_A OPI OUTP CDA NCDA VDD VSS eeg_afe_output_tg
XON_A ONI OUTN CDA NCDA VDD VSS eeg_afe_output_tg
XOP_B OPI OUTN CDB NCDB VDD VSS eeg_afe_output_tg
XON_B ONI OUTP CDB NCDB VDD VSS eeg_afe_output_tg
XCMFB OPI ONI VCM VBCM VBP VDD VSS eeg_afe_cmfb
XCCP VBP OPI cap_mim_2f0ff c_length=70.65u c_width=70.65u
XCCN VBP ONI cap_mim_2f0ff c_length=70.65u c_width=70.65u
.ends eeg_afe_amp

* electrode-offset cancellation DAC (tracker B7), sign-magnitude
* PH: DAC phase, toggles when the input-chopper TG of the new phase closes (high in
* phase A). X = S XOR PH. Active bit k (Mk and its group enabled): P plate = VDD when
* not X, N plate = VDD when X; inactive plates stay at VSS. For S = 0 the P plates rise
* at the A->B edge: +sum(active Ck) x VDD into INP cancels the Cin step of a positive
* ELP-ELN offset, magnitude x 0.311 mV per unit (60 fF). Each plate is driven through
* R_k = 65 ns / C_k (thermal noise grows with the active capacitance, i.e.
* with the cancelled offset). Inactive plates: clamped to VSS by an NMOS sized for
* R_on x C_k = 0.2 ns. Disabled groups: plates low, top plate at VCM.
.subckt eeg_afe_offdac INP INN VCM PH S M0 M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6 M7 M8 M9 EN0 EN1 EN2 EN3 VDD VSS
XSB SB S VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=1
XNPH NPH PH VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=2
XMXA S XR NPH PH VDD VSS eeg_afe_tg
XMXB SB XR PH NPH VDD VSS eeg_afe_tg
XXR1 XRB XR VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=2
XXR2 X XRB VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=8
XXR3 XB X VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=8
XENB0 ENB0 EN0 VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=1
XENB1 ENB1 EN1 VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=1
XENB2 ENB2 EN2 VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=1
XENB3 ENB3 EN3 VDD VSS eeg_afe_inv s=1
XRGP0N TP0 EN0 INP VSS nfet_03v3 W=10u L=0.28u nf=1 m=1
XRGP0P TP0 ENB0 INP VDD pfet_03v3 W=20u L=0.28u nf=2 m=1
XPKP0N TP0 ENB0 VCM VSS nfet_03v3 W=1u L=0.28u nf=1 m=1
XPKP0P TP0 EN0 VCM VDD pfet_03v3 W=2u L=0.28u nf=1 m=1
